<title>ANTIGUA AND BARBUDA: CRICKET-LEEWARD ISLANDS 33-0 IN 2ND INNS V SRI LANKA - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-LEEWARD ISLANDS 33-0 IN 2ND INNS V SRI LANKA - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leeward Islands, set 443 to win, were 33 without loss at tea on the final day of their three-day tour match against Sri Lanka on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 192-6 declared and 398-4 declared (R.Arnold 158, M.Atapattu 118). Leeward Islands 148 (M.Muralitharan 4-34) and 33-0.</p>
